    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ-έμετος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ-ήμετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμετος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vomiting readily</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				40
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐημετης, εὐήμετος</span>
			codd.):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ-εμής</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ-ημής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.169
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως εὐεμὲς ᾖ</span>
			(cod. Urb.) that <i>vomiting</i> may be <i>easy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.10.2
			</span></i>.</div>
